  "description": "带180°回转休息平台的平行双跑多踏步钢楼梯，可设置两梯段之间的梯井净宽。",
  "extensions": {
    "catalog": { "groupOrder": 30, "templateOrder": 40 },
    "productIdentity": { "codeParameter": "productCode" },
    "primaryDimensions": { "widthParameter": "stairWidth", "heightParameter": "floorHeight", "depthParameter": "landingLength" },
    "stairLayout": { "kind": "u-turn", "flightCount": 2, "landingCount": 1 },
    "parameterPresets": {
      "selectorParameter": "tubeSpecificationPreset", "customValue": "custom",
      "presets": [
        { "value": "residential_standard", "values": { "stringerWidth": 100.0, "stringerDepth": 50.0, "stringerCornerRadius": 3.0, "stringerWallThickness": 3.0, "treadWidth": 40.0, "treadDepthProfile": 40.0, "treadCornerRadius": 2.0, "treadWallThickness": 2.0, "handrailWidth": 40.0, "handrailDepth": 40.0, "handrailCornerRadius": 2.0, "handrailWallThickness": 1.5, "postWidth": 40.0, "postDepth": 40.0, "postCornerRadius": 2.0, "postWallThickness": 1.5 } },
